!!! archon/model/location.mat
!!! Where a finding was observed.
!!!
!!! A location is meaningful for any target kind: a line in source, a key in a
!!! configuration document, a field of a permission record, or a slot in live
!!! runtime state. `line` and `column` are zero when the target has no line
!!! structure.

book archon.model.location

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from ny.lang.text

public location begin record
    field target as text
    field path as text
    field line as number
    field column as number
    field excerpt as text
end record

!!! A compact `path:line:column` rendering.
public location-summary receives place as location returns text begin paragraph
    give place.path
        plus ":"
        plus (ny.lang.text::int_to_string_i64 with n being place.line)
        plus ":"
        plus (ny.lang.text::int_to_string_i64 with n being place.column)
end paragraph
